 ## Background
 *   **Origin:** Proposed in OD-NeRF: Efficient Training of On-the-Fly Dynamic Neural Radiance Fields [S1].
-*   **History:** The method addresses the limitation of static NeRF occupancy grids [13, 1] and 4D space-time grids [16] which do not improve on-the-fly efficiency. It formulates the problem using a Hidden Markov Model approach to transition and update the grid [S1].
-*   **Usage:** Evaluated on synthetic D-NeRF [18], real-world MeetRoom [6], and DyNeRF [8] datasets. It is particularly relevant for streaming scenarios with multi-view forward-facing cameras [S1].
